#: ../../api.md:1
msgid "API 参考"
msgstr "API reference"

#: ../../api.md:4
msgid ""
"**接口详情以在线文档为准**：`GET /api/v2/docs` 是 Swagger UI（可交互、可试请求）， 文档源是 `GET "
"/api/v2/openapi.json`（OpenAPI 3.0，可直接导入 Apifox / Postman / "
"Insomnia）。两者都支持 `?lang=zh|en`（页面右上角可切换）；不带该参数时跟随浏览器 `Accept-"
"Language`，认不出用中文。本文只保留跨接口的约定、鉴权流程与业务规则——**路径、参数、 "
"请求体、响应字段一律以在线文档为准**，不要在这里重复维护。"
msgstr "**The authoritative interface reference is the online documentation**: "
"`GET /api/v2/docs` is Swagger UI (interactive, requests can be tried), and "
"the source is `GET /api/v2/openapi.json` (OpenAPI 3.0, importable into "
"Apifox / Postman / Insomnia). Both accept `?lang=zh|en` (switchable in the "
"top right corner); without it the browser's `Accept-Language` decides, "
"falling back to Chinese. This page only keeps the cross-cutting "
"conventions, the authentication flow and the business rules — **paths, "
"parameters, request bodies and response fields always come from the online "
"documentation**, which is not duplicated here."

#: ../../api.md:11
msgid "约定"
msgstr "Conventions"

#: ../../api.md:13
msgid "业务接口前缀 `/api/v2`，请求与响应都是 JSON（上传除外，走 `multipart/form-data`）。"
msgstr ""
"Business endpoints live under `/api/v2`; requests and responses are JSON "
"(uploads excepted, they use `multipart/form-data`)."

#: ../../api.md:14
msgid ""
"根路径上还有两个不属于 `/api/v2` 的端点：`GET /raw/<sha>`（图片输出，已发布直链的兜底） 与 `GET "
"/i/<sha>`（旧版直链，跳转到 `/raw/`）。油猴脚本在 `/api/v2/userscript.user.js`。"
msgstr ""
"Two endpoints at the root do not belong to `/api/v2`: `GET /raw/<sha>` "
"(image output, the fallback for already-published direct links) and `GET "
"/i/<sha>` (legacy direct links, redirecting to `/raw/`). The userscript "
"lives at `/api/v2/userscript.user.js`."

#: ../../api.md:16
msgid "**成功**："
msgstr "**Success**:"

#: ../../api.md:22
msgid "**失败**："
msgstr "**Failure**:"

#: ../../api.md:28
msgid ""
"`code` 取自 `sapic/basis/errors.py` 的 `ErrorCode`： `BAD_REQUEST` / "
"`PARAM_ERROR` / `UNAUTHORIZED` / `FORBIDDEN` / `NOT_FOUND` / "
"`METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED` / `CONFLICT` / `PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE` / `RATE_LIMITED` "
"/ `INTERNAL_ERROR` / `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE`。"
msgstr ""
"`code` comes from `ErrorCode` in `sapic/basis/errors.py`: `BAD_REQUEST` /"
" `PARAM_ERROR` / `UNAUTHORIZED` / `FORBIDDEN` / `NOT_FOUND` / "
"`METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED` / `CONFLICT` / `PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE` / `RATE_LIMITED` "
"/ `INTERNAL_ERROR` / `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE`."

#: ../../api.md:33
msgid ""
"`message` 固定英文，由前端 `web/src/api/messages.js` 映射成中文展示； 排查问题时可把响应头 / 响应体里的 "
"`request_id` 与服务端日志对上。"
msgstr ""
"`message` is always English; the front end maps it to Chinese through "
"`web/src/api/messages.js`. When debugging, match the `request_id` from "
"the response headers or body against the server logs."

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "限速"
msgstr "Rate limiting"

#: ../../api.md:38
msgid ""
"所有 `/api/` 请求按客户端计数：已登录用户按账号、匿名请求按 IP。默认每分钟 120 次， "
"可在后台「站点设置 → 系统」的「API 限速」调整，`0` 表示关闭。超限返回 `429`、 "
"`code` 为 `RATE_LIMITED`，并带 `Retry-After`（秒）响应头；`GET /api/v2/health` 与 "
"`/raw/` 等非 API 路径不计数。计数器保存在进程内，多 worker 部署时每个 worker 各自计数。"
msgstr ""
"Every `/api/` request is counted per client: signed-in users by account, "
"anonymous requests by IP. The default is 120 per minute; adjust it under "
"Admin → Site settings → System (\"API rate limit\"), and `0` disables it. "
"Exceeding it returns `429` with `code: RATE_LIMITED` and a `Retry-After` "
"header in seconds; `GET /api/v2/health` and non-API paths such as `/raw/` "
"are never counted. Counters live in the process, so a multi-worker "
"deployment counts separately per worker."

#: ../../api.md:44
msgid ""
"这是**传输层**信封。钩子动作、数据集等内部返回值会原样放进 `data`，里面可能再有 `code` / `message` "
"字段——那是业务层结果，与这里的 `code` 不是一回事， 详见[钩子基础契约](extend/contract.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This is the **transport-level** envelope. Hook actions, data sources and "
"other internal return values are placed in `data` verbatim and may "
"contain their own `code` / `message` — that is a business-level result, "
"unrelated to the `code` here; see [Hook basics](extend/contract.md)."

#: ../../api.md:42
msgid "鉴权"
msgstr "Authentication"

#: ../../api.md:44
msgid "两种方式，任选其一；全局 CSRF 中间件没有任何端点例外。"
msgstr "Two options, pick one; the global CSRF middleware has no exceptions."

#: ../../api.md:46
msgid ""
"**会话 Cookie**（浏览器）：先 `GET /api/v2/auth/csrf` 拿 CSRF 令牌， "
"写操作（POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE）带 `X-CSRF-Token` 请求头。登录成功后 `POST /auth/login` "
"的响应里也会返回最新令牌；改密码会吊销其它会话并换发新令牌。"
msgstr ""
"**Session cookie** (browser): fetch a CSRF token with `GET "
"/api/v2/auth/csrf` first, then send it in the `X-CSRF-Token` header for "
"writes (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE). A successful `POST /auth/login` also "
"returns the latest token; changing the password revokes other sessions "
"and rotates the token."

#: ../../api.md:49
msgid ""
"**个人访问令牌（PAT）**：`Authorization: Bearer sp_xxxxxxxx`。令牌有四档 scope： "
"`read`（安全方法）、`upload`（上传）、`write`（其它改动）、`admin`（管理接口）， 缺省 `read` / "
"`upload` / `write`；`admin` 只有管理员能申请。"
msgstr ""
"**Personal access token (PAT)**: `Authorization: Bearer sp_xxxxxxxx`. "
"Tokens have four scopes: `read` (safe methods), `upload` (uploads), "
"`write` (other changes) and `admin` (management endpoints); the default "
"is `read` / `upload` / `write`, and only administrators can request "
"`admin`."

#: ../../api.md:53
msgid "客户端（PicGo / uPic / Typora 等）带不了 CSRF 头，一律用 PAT，配置方式见[快捷上传](usage.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Clients (PicGo / uPic / Typora …) cannot send a CSRF header, so they "
"always use a PAT; setup is in [Quick upload](usage.md)."

#: ../../api.md:55
msgid "**权限边界**："
msgstr "**Permission boundaries**:"

#: ../../api.md:57
msgid ""
"`status=1`（正常）与 `status=-1`（待审核）的账号能登录、持有会话或使用 PAT；待审核账号 "
"只是不能上传图片，已拒绝、禁用一律无效。"
msgstr "Accounts with `status=1` (active) and `status=-1` (pending review) can "
"sign in, hold a session or use a PAT; a pending account simply cannot "
"upload images, while rejected and disabled accounts have no access at all."

#: ../../api.md:59
msgid ""
"PAT 创建时可选 `album_id`（上传默认相册）：上传不带 `album_id` 时落到它，相册被删或 "
"失去写权限后回落到用户默认相册；请求里显式传的 `album_id` 永远优先。"
msgstr ""
"A PAT can pin a default upload album (`album_id` at creation): uploads "
"without `album_id` land there, and fall back to the user default album "
"when the album is deleted or write permission is lost; an explicit "
"`album_id` in the request always wins."

#: ../../api.md:61
msgid ""
"上传接口允许匿名（站点 `allow_anonymous_upload` 打开时），所以它不用登录装饰器， 而是在视图内单独校验 `upload`"
" scope。"
msgstr ""
"The upload endpoint allows anonymous requests (when the site enables "
"`allow_anonymous_upload`), so it does not use the login decorator and "
"validates the `upload` scope inside the view instead."

#: ../../api.md:63
msgid ""
"站点在后台关闭 `upload_enabled` 后，`POST /upload` 对所有凭据返回 403——只冻结新增， "
"已有图片的访问、编辑与删除不受影响。"
msgstr ""
"With `upload_enabled` switched off in the admin, `POST /upload` returns "
"403 for every credential — it only freezes new uploads; accessing, "
"editing and deleting existing images is unaffected."

#: ../../api.md:66
msgid ""
"在 Swagger UI 里点 **Authorize** 填 PAT 即可试请求；用浏览器会话试写接口时页面会自动补 `X-CSRF-"
"Token`。"
msgstr ""
"In Swagger UI, click **Authorize** and paste a PAT to try requests; when "
"trying write endpoints with a browser session the page adds `X-CSRF-"
"Token` automatically."

#: ../../api.md:69
msgid "分页"
msgstr "Pagination"

#: ../../api.md:71
msgid "列表接口默认为游标分页："
msgstr "List endpoints use cursor pagination by default:"

#: ../../api.md:81
msgid "`limit` 上限 100；翻页只用 `next_cursor`，不要自己算 offset。"
msgstr ""
"`limit` is capped at 100; page through with `next_cursor` only, do not "
"compute offsets yourself."

#: ../../api.md:83
msgid ""
"图片列表（`GET /api/v2/images`）额外支持页码模式，给带页码器的界面用：传 `page` 即切换 （`page_size` 默认"
" 15、上限 100），响应多一个 `total`："
msgstr ""
"The image list (`GET /api/v2/images`) also supports page mode for "
"interfaces with a pager: passing `page` switches to it (`page_size` "
"defaults to 15, maximum 100) and the response gains a `total`:"

#: ../../api.md:94
msgid ""
"两种模式排序一致（`created_at` 倒序、`id` 兜底），不带 `page` 时行为保持不变。 后台接口（如 `GET "
"/users`）只提供页码模式，默认每页 15，前端用页码器直接跳页。"
msgstr ""
"Both modes sort the same way (`created_at` descending, `id` as tie-"
"breaker), and behaviour without `page` is unchanged. Admin endpoints "
"(such as `GET /users`) only offer page mode, 15 per page by default, so "
"the front end can jump pages directly."

