#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "`file`"
msgstr "`file`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "文件域，与 `url` 二选一"
msgstr "File part; alternative to `url`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid ""
"图片地址，由服务端抓取后入库：**必须是域名**（不接受 `http://1.2.3.4/…` 这类 IP "
"字面量），**不跟随重定向**（源站返回 3xx 即报错）。站点若配了 "
"`upload_fetch_proxy`，只有管理员的抓取才会在直连失败后走代理"
msgstr ""
"Image URL, fetched by the server and stored: it **must be a domain** (IP "
"literals such as `http://1.2.3.4/…` are rejected) and **redirects are not"
" followed** (a 3xx from the origin is an error). If the site configures "
"`upload_fetch_proxy`, only administrator fetches fall back to the proxy "
"after a direct failure"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "`album_id`"
msgstr "`album_id`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "可选，相册 ID（需登录且对该相册有写权限）；不带时用 PAT 的默认相册，再兜底到用户默认相册"
msgstr ""
"Optional album ID (requires a login and write permission on that album); "
"when omitted the PAT default album applies, then the user default album"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "`title`"
msgstr "`title`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "可选，标题"
msgstr "Optional title"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "`expire`"
msgstr "`expire`"

#: ../../api.md:36
msgid "可选，有效期（秒）；留空用站点默认值，`0` 表示永久"
msgstr ""
"Optional expiry in seconds; empty uses the site default, `0` means "
"permanent"

#: ../../api.md:116
msgid "图片对象在 `data.image` 里，地址取 `data.image.src`："
msgstr "The image object is in `data.image`; take the URL from `data.image.src`:"

