#: ../../api.md:161
msgid "钩子相关接口见[钩子基础契约](extend/contract.md)的「相关接口」一节。"
msgstr ""
"Hook endpoints are in the Related endpoints section of [Hook "
"basics](extend/contract.md)."

#: ../../api.md:163
msgid "可见性与地址"
msgstr "Visibility and URLs"

#: ../../api.md:165
msgid "可见性的维度是**相册**，单张图片可以覆盖："
msgstr "Visibility is decided per **album**, with a per-image override:"

#: ../../api.md:167
msgid ""
"每张图片都必须属于一个相册；`images.visibility` 为 `null` 表示跟随相册，为 `public` / `private` "
"时覆盖相册。图片不能被摘出相册（`PATCH` 传空 `album_id` 直接 400）， 否则「无相册 + 无覆盖」会被当成公开而泄漏。"
msgstr ""
"Every image belongs to an album; `images.visibility` set to `null` "
"follows the album, and `public` / `private` overrides it. An image can "
"never be pulled out of its album (`PATCH` with an empty `album_id` "
"returns 400), otherwise no album plus no override would be treated as "
"public and leak."

#: ../../api.md:170
msgid ""
"登录用户上传落到**默认相册**（可见性取站点设置 `default_album_visibility`），匿名上传落到 "
"**系统相册**（管理员能在相册列表里看到 `role=system` 那条，用于筛选匿名图片）。"
msgstr ""
"A signed-in upload lands in the **default album** (visibility from the "
"site setting `default_album_visibility`), an anonymous upload lands in "
"the **system album** (administrators see the `role=system` row in the "
"album list and can filter anonymous images with it)."

#: ../../api.md:172
msgid ""
"图库列表只含自己的图片 + 共享给自己的相册。**管理员也是个人图库**，要看全站必须显式传 "
"`scope=all`；该视图只放大到公开图片，别人的私有相册不会出现。非管理员传该参数 403。"
msgstr ""
"The library only lists your own images plus albums shared with you. "
"**Administrators also get a personal library**; to see the whole site you"
" must pass `scope=all`, and that view only widens to public images — "
"other people private albums never appear. Non-administrators passing the "
"parameter get 403."

#: ../../api.md:174
msgid ""
"`src` 已按可见性处理：公开图给存储直链（后端没配 `domain` 时回落到 `/raw/<sha>`）， 私有图固定 "
"`/raw/<sha>`。存储后端 `visibility=private`（私有读桶）时直链不对外使用， 所有访问都经 `/raw/<sha>`"
" 由驱动签发临时读地址后转发。"
msgstr ""
"`src` already reflects visibility: public images get the storage direct "
"link (falling back to `/raw/<sha>` when the backend has no `domain`), "
"private images always get `/raw/<sha>`. With a `visibility=private` "
"backend (private-read bucket) the direct link is never used externally; "
"every access goes through `/raw/<sha>`, where the driver issues a "
"temporary read URL and sapic proxies it."

#: ../../api.md:177
msgid ""
"被内容审核拦截的图（`review_state=block`）收口的是**本站入口**：`/raw/<sha>` 对匿名与其他 用户返回 "
"403，公开列表与广场也不再列出；本人与管理员仍可访问。如果 `src` 是公有桶直链， 那条 URL "
"已经脱离本站控制，彻底撤回需要管理员删除图片（`purge`）或调整桶权限。"
msgstr "Images blocked by moderation (`review_state=block`) are closed off at "
"**this site's entry points**: `/raw/<sha>` returns 403 to anonymous and "
"other users, and public lists and the plaza stop showing them; the owner "
"and admins can still access them. If `src` points straight at a public "
"bucket, that URL is already outside the site's control — a full retraction "
"needs an admin to delete the image (`purge`) or change the bucket policy."

#: ../../api.md:180
msgid ""
"广场（`/plaza`）默认关闭，`plaza_enabled` 关掉时直接 404。只有可见性为 `public` 且经 相册开关 + "
"单图三态显式发布的图片才进列表。"
msgstr ""
"The plaza (`/plaza`) is off by default and returns 404 while "
"`plaza_enabled` is off. Only images whose visibility is `public` and that"
" were explicitly published through the album switch plus the per-image "
"tri-state enter the list."

#: ../../api.md:182
msgid ""
"图片有效期用 `expire`（秒）在**上传时**确定，省略取站点默认、0 表示永久，上限由站点设置 控制；之后通过 `PATCH` 的 "
"`expire_at`（绝对时间戳）调整。"
msgstr ""
"Image expiry is fixed at **upload time** via `expire` (seconds): omitted "
"uses the site default, 0 means permanent, and the ceiling is controlled "
"by the site settings. It is adjusted later with `expire_at` (absolute "
"timestamp) in `PATCH`."

#~ msgid "站点设置、版本检测、用户审核与禁用"
#~ msgstr "Site settings, update check, user review and disabling"

